MODIFICATIONS FROM PREVIOUS VERSION:

Math Game Logic is now written:
- 2 numbers are randomly generated
- also used random number generation to randomly choose an operator (only uses + or - for now)
- correct answer is generated using the 2 numbers and operator
    when - is chosen, extra logic is implemented so that answer is always positive
- 4 incorrect answers are generated and assigned to each button
- correct answer is then randomly assigned to one of the four buttons
- user input is then read
- if user chooses correctly then score is increase by 1 /
if user chooses incorrectly then a life is lost
